WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.939
A semialgebraic conjecture.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:07.180
When can a universal cover be cut out by real polynomial inequalities?

3
00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:11.123
Only symmetric domain, times flat space, times a compact piece.

4
00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:14.434
Claimed: those products are the only possible ones.

5
00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:17.522
Lean checks only one half.
